BEGIN_TEXT
The main screen shows the station at a glance: your call and the UTC clock
on the top line, the help line at the bottom, and below it the status
strip: messages queued, one on the air, failures, the link, and EMCON.

Forms (setup, cards, keymasters, channels, schedules, tapes and bundles)
and training are on the main menu. Getting started (START) walks you
through the first steps in order.
END
